- Top failure pattern: {most_common_pattern}

---
*Log more with `/failure` | See patterns with `/failure patterns`*
```

### Subcommands

**`/failure list`** — Show all failures
**`/failure patterns`** — Group failures by pattern type, show frequencies
**`/failure search <keyword>`** — Search by company or cause
